  "description": "Moradia T4 de 3 pisos para venda a 300.000&euro;\n\n&nbsp;\n\nMoradia T4 convertida em T6 localizada em zona residencial de Macedo de Cavaleiros.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nA moradia tem &aacute;reas generosas com um total de 520m2 de &aacute;rea bruta dos quais 320m2 representam &aacute;rea bruta privativa. &Eacute; composta por R/ch, 1&ordm;; 2&ordm; andar; 3&ordm; andar&nbsp;e conta ainda com um anexo e terra&ccedil;o exterior.\n\nA Moradia &eacute; composta por:\n\nR/CH: Garagem com capacidade para 5 carros;\n\n1&ordm;Andar: Sala; 2 WC;&nbsp;Cozinha;\n\n2&ordm; Andar:&nbsp;4 Quartos; 2 WC;&nbsp;\n\n3&ordm;Andar: Apartamento T2 no &uacute;ltimo piso;\n\nAnexo exterior: Cozinha assim como casa de m&aacute;quinas;\n\n&nbsp;\n\nA moradia neste momento encontra-se desabitada pelo que os propriet&aacute;rios est&atilde;o a retirar o mobili&aacute;rio da&iacute; estarem v&aacute;rias caixas nas fotografias.\n\n&nbsp;\n\nNas proximidades:\n\n&nbsp;\n\nEscola Profissional Jean Piaget de Macedo de Cavaleiros - 75 Metros\n\nCentro Cultural de Macedo de Cavaleiros - 240 Metros\n\nFarm&aacute;cia - 240 M\n\nPavilh&atilde;o Municipal de Macedo de Cavaleiros - 350 Metros\n\nEntrada da Autoestrada - 3,5 Km\n\nN&atilde;o Perca esta oportunidade !&nbsp;\n\nAgende visita e venha conhecer a sua futura Casa\n\n&nbsp;\n\nIngl&ecirc;s:\n\n4-bedroom house with 3 floors for sale at &euro;300.000\n\n4-bedroom house converted into a 6-bedroom house located in a residential area in Macedo de Cavaleiros.\n\nThe house features generous spaces with a total of 520m2 of gross area, of which 320m2 represent the private gross area. It consists of the ground floor, 1st floor, 2nd floor, and 3rd floor, and also includes an annex and an exterior terrace.\n\nThe house is composed of:\n\nGround floor: Garage with space for 5 cars;\n\n1st floor: Living room; 2 bathrooms; Kitchen;\n\n2nd floor: 4 bedrooms; 2 bathrooms;\n\n3rd floor: 2-bedroom apartment on the top floor;\n\nExterior annex: Kitchen and utility room;\n\nThe house is currently unoccupied, and the owners are in the process of removing the furniture, which is why you see several boxes in the photos.\n\nNearby:\n\nProfessional School Jean Piaget in Macedo de Cavaleiros - 75 meters\n\nMacedo de Cavaleiros Cultural Center - 240 meters\n\nPharmacy - 240 meters\n\nMacedo de Cavaleiros Municipal Pavilion - 350 meters\n\nHighway entrance - 3.5 km\n\n&nbsp;\n\n&nbsp;\n\nDon't miss this opportunity!\n\nSchedule a visit and come see your future home.\n\n&nbsp;",
